  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Prep ingredients: Preheat the grill to high. Thinly slice the pak choy with a sharp knife. Shred the carrot using a julienne peeler or coarsely grate with a box grater. Combine half the tonkatsu sauce, 2 tsp honey and 1 tbs water in a bowl.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4055384/photos/large/78507_1-ddf8ca084d03987ec21e2bf5fe37aaca.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm tofu: Heat 1 tbs vegetable oil in a medium frypan over medium heat. Cook the tofu for 2 mins each side. Add the tonkatsu mixture and cook, turning, for a further 2 mins or until the tofu is well coated. Remove the pan from the heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4055387/photos/large/78507_2-3b708672f671a79538c783622e7fe528.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Toast buns: Meanwhile, cut the buns in half. Put on an oven tray, cut-side up, and grill for 2-3 mins until lightly toasted.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4055389/photos/large/78507_3-0641607819dfaa6eb2169befd8195937.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Make slaw: Combine 2 tbs mayonnaise and 2 tsp white vinegar in a large bowl. Add the pak choy, carrot and fried shallots, season with salt and pepper and toss to combine.",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4055391/photos/large/78507_4-086cd14460ab47d1a4f25ed918ad3a27.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve up: Layer the bun bases with the slaw and glazed tofu, then sandwich with the tops. Divide the burgers and remaining slaw among plates and enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4055392/photos/large/78507_5-4d3dcc1214eecd63099a72dfb6408895.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "Did you know?: Pak choy has a mild flavour that is not only perfect for stir-fries and soups but also slaws and salads!",
      "imageUrl": "https://marleyspoon.com/media/recipe_card_steps/4055393/photos/large/78507_6-63598222cf3cc779b0f8a4c30f2d7d66.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
